WEBVTT

00:00:00.450 --> 00:00:03.145
Your next service starts long before the first plate.

00:00:06.950 --> 00:00:11.615
Start with your menu, read a photo,

00:00:11.855 --> 00:00:14.915
check the text, and review the ingredients before you approve.

00:00:28.400 --> 00:00:29.305
Looking for suppliers?

00:00:29.965 --> 00:00:31.105
Choose what you need and where.

00:00:31.745 --> 00:00:36.685
Search external websites, then add a supplier you've reviewed.

00:00:43.400 --> 00:00:44.645
Open a price request.

00:00:47.665 --> 00:00:50.745
New suppliers can apply and your team controls who can quote.

00:00:58.350 --> 00:01:00.485
They send their prices through a private link.

00:01:07.000 --> 00:01:08.135
Compare the full cost.

00:01:10.055 --> 00:01:13.275
Here, a lower price per kilo costs more after delivery.

00:01:20.145 --> 00:01:22.145
Choose your supplier and record the decision.

00:01:31.450 --> 00:01:35.225
When the order arrives, check the invoice and save the delivery
record.

00:01:42.500 --> 00:01:44.135
Next time, open your history.

00:01:44.975 --> 00:01:47.595
Repeat the purchase as a new draft ready for review.

00:01:55.150 --> 00:01:57.345
QuotePlate. Keep every purchase clear.
